    "body": "The existing first Jacobian seven-transfer now evaluates with F101 arithmetic throughout. Standalone PrimeFieldPsi uses both exact T0 quartic norms,public quarter scalars82/85,the selected actual elliptic alpha7 maps and two direct T1 pullbacks. SevenChain.forward selects this evaluator;its exact old body remains forward_reference and the new complete comparison calls that explicit reference. The retained comparison context still constructs old maps for olddual/generic/geometric controls. Existing field/poly/elliptic/Kohel/Balanced engines are reused;the existing balanced reduction arithmetic is byte-exact after extraction. Scientific standing unsigned. [pcc:unverified]\n\nComplete changed check.sh04 exits0:25native/90reference unit+five integrations,one pre-existing ignored benchmark,all digest/fmt/strictClippy guards. Every12317 concrete old forward output,bijection,paired sums,negation,identity/model and selected-alpha coefficients agree. All4pullbacks additionally check every109/113 input,49300 ordered elliptic additions,norm4/offdiagonal0 and actual signed infinity drops. Original85 tests plus generic/naive/olddual/R0/R1/R2/Phi/Psi/source/geometric/chained controls remain. Full result76871d pins the entire131756-byte raw log as standardXZ14932bytes with raw/archive hashes,exact roundtrip and all8source02 hashes unchanged. Interrupted03 partial48451bytes/metadata/sourcehash f87a99 is preserved. [pcc:unverified]\n\nPRIME_FIELD_PSI.md,QUARTIC_PULLBACKS.md,T0_SECOND_QUARTIC.md/1ebbb3 retain upstream78176c/4934b4/a38aa4:exact curve identities/degree4,Milne arbitrary-map difference bound16 and enough distinct agreements,old quotient/Picard/polarization dependencies,finite-algebra jets/denominator units and exact infinity bookkeeping. Rational quarters evaluate the old map on its fixed odd rational group;no global inverse morphism of[4] is constructed. Formalization remains partial. Source-linked DOT/SVG/Typst/PDF52561bytes/two final inspected pages are6a9aa0. Packaging4faed6:ledger133 prefix/chain,benchrec16/progress,prose0 pass;verify-all130records128not_covered/two local Leanpass/zero fail,expectedexit2. [pcc:unverified]\n\nHead **b2972eb51fd794e1a6061c41fd5f3828890c08e3**,treeae092d91f6c5873a6c4d288eab67ef6b32c15352. Depends on #1505 and targets immediate research/chained-transfer-quartic-covers-20261112 at6cf2f1a9902b3babeec56d62a9983891b9ffb079. Parent exact focused43165729371 succeeds25native/85reference+five/one oldignored;complete decoded182753-byte log→XZ24748/API/hash/roundtrip fd53e1 is archived here. Parent remains fixed;this new head needs its own focusedCI/review. Feature-base auto-merge unavailable;integrate bottom-up and retarget/rerun after parents land,with all actual gates. Frozen-ledger forks/parent1484 C findings/conflict remain. [pcc:unverified]\n\nPRIME_FIELD_STATUS.md,upstream#3877 and queue3904 preserve resume state. Isolated upstream adjointdcbb58,T2adapters e383f2 and compressedtwohop8e0523 are separate continuation work outside this90-test checkpoint. Matched cold construction/transfer/solve/recovery/verification costs await S3/profile/livebudget admission. KB/ecdb unavailable,atlas8edec422a vault locked/KEY absent;no solver,benchmark,paidjob,bypass,plaintext write,rebase,force,rechain or lineage choice. No measured computational advantage or novelty claim. [pcc:unverified]",
